sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Web app
  participant API as Friday API
  participant RL as Rate limiter
  participant DB as Supabase
  participant ST as File storage
  participant M as AI model

  U->>FE: Type message and attach files
  FE->>API: POST /api/chat with JWT
  API->>RL: Check per-user limit
  alt Over limit
    API-->>FE: 429 Too many requests
  else Allowed
    API->>DB: Save user message
    API->>ST: Store attachments
    API->>M: Stream the prompt
    M-->>API: Tokens plus usage
    API->>DB: Save reply and token cost
    API-->>FE: Live SSE text Think cites
    FE-->>U: Answer appears as it is written
  end
